{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>[You shall not eat of it</b> — this implies: you shall not eat, nor any who belong to you; therefore Eve was punished]. <b>For on the day of your eating of it, you shall surely die.</b> Adam was not created on a plan that he would die, but when he sinned, death was decreed upon him — that is, if you eat of it, your end is to die, and you will not be able to escape death at the appointed time. He did not say that he would die on that very day, and therefore he was distanced from the Tree of Life, lest he return to his original state and live forever, and it become necessary to impose death upon him by decree."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:31.872138049Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}